    <description
  >Finds a guest/tenant/client contact through PMS guest matching (exact email, never OTA relay addresses). If none matches, creates a person account record (Account + Contact) with the given PMS party role and flags possible duplicates for staff review. Returns accountId and contactId for bookings.</description>
    <formulas>
        <name>guestFullName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression
    >TRIM({!firstName} &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; {!lastName})</expression>
    </formulas>
